Package: armatos-damnatio
Version: 2779.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: armatos-voice, btrfs-progs, util-linux, sudo
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: damnatio memoriae — snapshots and rollback
 Takes a read-only Btrfs snapshot of the root before every APT run and lets
 you return to any earlier one with "damnatio restore N". /home is never
 touched. Expects the Armatos layout: @, @home and @snapshots, with root
 mounted by subvol=@.
